Manage custom metrics in the Metrics Library

Usage: vendo metrics [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List all custom metrics
  get       Get metric details
  create    Create a new metric
  update    Update a metric
  activate  Activate a draft metric
  delete    Delete a metric
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
